mediafin-gtk: --press-clear-history renames everything a scan proposes and then destroys the undo journal. MEDIAFIN_CONFIG_DIR points at the configuration directory the program would have used anyway (/tmp/tmp.EvqJD9fy8n/.config/mediafin). Point it at a throwaway library first: set MEDIAFIN_CONFIG_DIR to a directory you do not mind losing, or add --demo.
